                          "text":  "In 1990, my team asked me to turn around and take one last set of pictures. From six billion kilometres away, Earth was a pale blue dot, smaller than a single pixel. Then they switched my cameras off for good, to save power.\n\nI kept flying. In August 2012 I crossed the edge of the Sun\u0027s bubble and entered the space between the stars. I was the first thing from Earth ever to do that.",
